// The core/uuid conformance package.
//
// Two seeded doubles make the generators checkable: `entropy()` draws the same
// octets on both backends, and `clock()` is at whatever the test puts it at. So
// a version 4 and a version 7 identifier both have an answer that can be written
// down, and the value crossing the runtime — sixteen octets in, thirty-six
// characters out — is asserted rather than assumed.
